<!doctype html><html lang="ru"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>ПрофиСпорт — управление</title><style>:root{--y:#f2c94c;--g:#34383d;--bg:#f4f4f1;--tx:#202124;--muted:#777b80;--line:#e5e5e1;--glassLine:#ffffff18}*{box-sizing:border-box}html:not(.admin-authenticated) #app{display:none!important}html.admin-authenticated #login,html.admin-authenticated #setup{display:none!important}body{margin:0;font:15px/1.45 system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--tx)}button,input,textarea{font:inherit}.topbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;background:#0d141f;color:#fff;padding:14px 18px}.topbarInner,main{max-width:1180px;margin:auto}.brand,.authLogo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:850;font-size:21px}.brandMark{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--y);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#1d1f21;font-weight:900}main{padding:18px}.card,.stat,.navCard{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px}.card{padding:20px;margin:14px 0}.row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.row>*{flex:1}.grid2,.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.stats{margin:14px 0}.stat{padding:18px}.stat b{font-size:30px;display:block}.stat span,.muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}input,textarea{width:100%;padding:13px 14px;border:1px solid #d9dad6;border-radius:12px;margin:6px 0 10px;background:#fff;outline:none}button{appearance:none;-webkit-appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;background:var(--y);color:#151515!important;-webkit-text-fill-color:#151515!important;font-weight:800}.secondary{background:#ecece8}.hidden{display:none!important}.authWrap{min-height:calc(100vh - 62px);display:grid;place-items:center;padding:22px;background:#0d141f}.authCard{width:min(460px,100%);padding:26px;border-radius:28px;color:#f7f8fb;background:#ffffff10;border:1px solid var(--glassLine)}.authCard h2{font-size:31px}.authCard input{height:58px;background:#ffffff0d;border:1px solid #ffffff22;color:#fff}.sectionHead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:center}.heroTitle{font-size:32px}.navCards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px}.navCard{padding:14px;font-weight:800}.navCard small{display:block;color:var(--muted)}.msg{padding:10px 0}.ok{color:#17833d}.err{color:#cf392d}@media(max-width:760px){.grid2,.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr}.navCards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.row{display:block}.card{padding:16px}main{padding:12px}}</style></head><body><header class="topbar"><div class="topbarInner"><div class="brand"><span class="brandMark">П</span><span>ПрофиСпорт</span></div></div></header><div id="setup" class="authWrap hidden"><section class="authCard"><h2>Создание пароля</h2><input id="newPassword" type="password"><input id="confirmPassword" type="password"><button id="setupBtn">Сохранить пароль</button><div id="setupMsg" class="msg"></div></section></div><div id="login" class="authWrap hidden"><section class="authCard"><h2>Вход</h2><input id="username" value="Иван Кириллов 414" readonly><input id="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="Пароль админки"><button id="loginBtn">Войти</button><div id="loginMsg" class="msg"></div></section></div><main id="app" class="hidden"><div class="sectionHead"><div><h1 class="heroTitle">Управление магазином</h1><p>Товары, импорт, заказы и настройки.</p></div><div><b id="who"></b> · <button id="logout" class="secondary">Выйти</button></div></div><section class="stats"><div class="stat"><span>Товаров в базе</span><b id="statProducts">—</b></div><div class="stat"><span>Новых заказов</span><b id="statOrders">—</b></div></section><section class="navCards"><div class="navCard">Товары<small>Каталог</small></div><div class="navCard">Импорт<small>1С, MySQL, CSV</small></div><div class="navCard">Заказы<small>Заявки магазина</small></div><div class="navCard">Настройки<small>Магазин</small></div></section><section class="card"><h2>Сменить пароль админки</h2><p class="muted">Задай новый пароль. Старый пароль не требуется, пока ты вошёл как владелец.</p><div class="grid2"><input id="changePassword" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Новый пароль, минимум 10 символов"><input id="changePassword2" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Повтори новый пароль"></div><button id="changePasswordBtn">Сохранить новый пароль</button><div id="changePasswordMsg" class="msg"></div></section><section class="card"><h2>Входящие файлы 1С / MySQL</h2><button id="refreshImports" class="secondary">Обновить список</button><div id="importFiles">Пока не проверено</div></section><section class="card"><h2>Импорт старого каталога</h2><button id="importBtn">Импортировать каталог</button><div id="importMsg" class="msg"></div></section><section class="card"><h2>Настройки магазина</h2><div class="grid2"><label>Название<input id="site_name"></label><label>Город<input id="city"></label><label>Адрес<input id="address"></label><label>Валюта<input id="currency"></label></div><button id="saveSettings">Сохранить настройки</button><div id="settingsMsg" class="msg"></div></section><section class="card"><h2>Товары</h2><div class="row"><input id="q" placeholder="Название товара"><button id="searchBtn">Найти</button></div><div id="products"></div></section></main><script src="app.js?v=10"></script></body></html>